{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_35333","headline":"试月中桂 · 张乔","name":"试月中桂","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"与月转洪蒙，扶疎万古同。\n根非生下土，叶不坠秋风。\n每以圆时足，还随缺处空。\n影高羣木外，香满一轮中。\n未种丹霄日，应虚玉兔宫。\n何当因羽化，细得问玄功。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"张乔","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_35333.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_35333","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}